            "detailed_description": "Rendered in rich detail, four of the world’s greatest cities - Vienna, Helsinki, Berlin, and Amsterdam - await the steady hand of a planner to manage their transportation needs in <strong>Cities in Motion.</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t\tOverseeing the changing needs of people from 1920 to 2020, it’s up to you to manage everything from buses, trams and subway trains to maximize profits while pleasing commuters.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore four different cities: Vienna, Helsinki, Berlin, and Amsterdam<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Engage in a campaign with 12 scenarios, as well as a sandbox mode where all campaign cities are playable<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Experience realistic 3D graphics with more than 100 unique, highly detailed buildings<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Use the advanced map editor to create your own cities<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Play through 100 years of transportation history throughout four eras spanning from 1920 to 2020<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Choose between more than 30 different vehicles based on real-life models of buses, trams, water buses, helicopters, and subways, complete with an underground view<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Experience a real-time city and traffic simulator as each location's bustling population commutes between their homes, jobs, and leisure sites<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Rendered in rich detail, four of the world’s greatest cities - Vienna, Helsinki, Berlin, and Amsterdam - await the steady hand of a planner to manage their transportation needs in <strong>Cities in Motion.</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t\tOverseeing the changing needs of people from 1920 to 2020, it’s up to you to manage everything from buses, trams and subway trains to maximize profits while pleasing commuters.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore four different cities: Vienna, Helsinki, Berlin, and Amsterdam<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Engage in a campaign with 12 scenarios, as well as a sandbox mode where all campaign cities are playable<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Experience realistic 3D graphics with more than 100 unique, highly detailed buildings<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Use the advanced map editor to create your own cities<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Play through 100 years of transportation history throughout four eras spanning from 1920 to 2020<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Choose between more than 30 different vehicles based on real-life models of buses, trams, water buses, helicopters, and subways, complete with an underground view<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Experience a real-time city and traffic simulator as each location's bustling population commutes between their homes, jobs, and leisure sites<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
